      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>This is an original Esperanto translation of Ein K’Eloheinu, with a transcription using my own original Hebraization schema. Thank you to Erin Piateski for invaluable help in the proofreading phase! I’ve also included a sheet-music setting of the text with the Ashkenazi-rite coda. A recording will be made in the near future.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
